	// character's last combat, once the combat is over (SRD 5.1, "Weapons": a minute spent searching the
	// battlefield). It works once for each combat. The character's player or the master. It writes the session
	// event `ammunition_recovered`.
	//
	// Errors: `permission_denied` as SpendCharges; `invalid_argument` when the character fired nothing in its last
	// combat (or fought none); `failed_precondition` with ChargesBlocked COMBAT_RUNNING while the character's
	// latest combat is not ended, and ALREADY_RECOVERED once the pieces were taken back.
	RecoverAmmunition(context.Context, *connect.Request[v1.RecoverAmmunitionRequest]) (*connect.Response[v1.RecoverAmmunitionResponse], error)
